nothing to act on yet
  acts   o closed
  full   [o show or hide closed sprints]
a board with no sprint on it
  acts   n new · o closed
  full   [n plan a new sprint, o show or hide closed sprints]
a planned sprint
  acts   s start · e edit · n new · o closed
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, home first sprint, end last sprint]
  full   [s start this sprint, e edit name, goal and dates, n plan a new sprint, o show or hide closed sprints]
a running sprint
  acts   c complete · e edit · n new · o closed
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, home first sprint, end last sprint]
  full   [c complete this sprint, e edit name, goal and dates, n plan a new sprint, o show or hide closed sprints]
a closed sprint
  acts   e edit · n new · o closed
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, home first sprint, end last sprint]
  full   [e edit name, goal and dates, n plan a new sprint, o show or hide closed sprints]
filling a sprint in
  acts   ctrl+s send it to Jira · tab next field · esc discard this edit
  full   [tab next field, shift+tab previous field]
  full   [ctrl+s send it to Jira, esc discard this edit]
  full   [alt+k delete to end of line]
answering the confirm
  acts   y go ahead · esc leave it alone
  full   [y go ahead, esc leave it alone]
